    "overview": "[Standing rule] Bachelor’s from an accredited institution, completed by enrollment; no master’s necessary. Advanced calculus and linear algebra competence expected. UChicago mathematics bachelor’s is an eligible credential route. Department expressly considers international assistantship candidates. [s1] [s2] [s3]",
