    "international": "[Standing rule] TOEFL minimum 90 before January 21, 2026 or 5.0 thereafter; IELTS 7.0; PTE 61. Valid two years; no Duolingo, IELTS Indicator/One Skill Retake, TOEFL MyBest or Essentials. TOEFL Home Edition accepted. Institution code 1105. [s2] [s3] [Standing rule] Completed bachelor’s or higher from an institution primarily teaching in English qualifies; indicate education waiver in application. Completed UChicago degree qualifies. Current wording does not expressly include an unfinished degree at application, so confirm if applying before conferral. [s1] [s2] [s3] [Standing rule] Department FAQ explicitly asks about international assistantship access and affirms equal opportunity; no blanket international exclusion is published. [s2]",
