    "deadlineDetails": "[2027 confirmed] 15 December 2026 for all application materials; clock/timezone not published in the checked math page. Incomplete applications are not considered; late letters may not be reviewed. Required Math GRE must be included; no public score/letter grace period established. [s1]",
    "funding": "[Prior cycle] 2026-27 published rates, not a 2027-28 offer: Ithaca assistantship USD 36,684/9 months plus USD 12,228/13-week summer = USD 48,912/12 months. University Fellowship USD 36,684 academic plus USD 7,779 summer = USD 44,463/12 months. Math guarantees tuition, health insurance and stipend including summer, but which fellowship/assistantship combination applies is in offer. Do not use Cornell Tech’s separate rate. [s10] [s9]",
