    "deadlineDetails": "[Standing rule] Mathematics specifies January 1 for PhD applications, aligning with CAS January 1 financial-aid consideration. Year/time zone are not stated. CAS June 30 without aid is a general deadline and should not replace mathematics January 1. [s1] [s3]",
