    "international": "[Standing rule] TOEFL, IELTS or DET for applicants not meeting an exemption. Acceptance of a new TOEFL scale is discussed on the central page; do not use an old score threshold without checking that page. [s7] [Standing rule] UChicago English-taught undergraduate degree qualifies if awarded before Princeton enrollment. Transcript must state English instruction or include an institutional letter/certificate in the same transcript upload. No separate waiver request required. [s7] [Standing rule] Central guarantee covers all degree-seeking PhD candidates during regular enrollment, without a nationality exception on this policy. Inference: international mathematics admit is included; external awards can have separate citizenship restrictions. [s11]",
