    "costs": "[Standing rule] $114 international; $89 domestic, nonrefundable, per Math PhD page. Central international admissions lists a $90 university fee plus the separate CAS processing charge; this need not contradict the department's $114 combined figure, but the final 2027 checkout total and CAS component should be confirmed. [s1] [s10]",
    "size": "University enrollment and mathematics cohort size are not verified in this dossier.",
