    "deadlineDetails": "[Standing rule] December 25: ALL materials must be received for fall PhD admission with funding consideration. Standing date, not explicitly Fall 2027; time zone unpublished. No separate letter or score grace period. International admitted students provide official degree-conferral records on arrival; clarify any earlier central checklist date. [s1]",
