    "deadlineDetails": "[Conflict] Department asks all materials by January 15 for fall and October 1 for spring to maximize admission chances; late applications depend on vacancies. The 2027 program portal instead displays no deadline/no priority deadline. Use January 15 as the prudent complete-file target and confirm this conflict. No summer intake. [s1] [s2]",
