    "overview": "[Standing rule] Bachelor’s by start of classes; minimum GPA 3.0/4.0. Math preparation comparable to Berkeley major expected, including real/complex analysis and abstract/linear algebra. UChicago math degree is an eligible route, subject to transcript review. [s3] [s2] [s1]",
