    "costs": "[Standing rule] International applicant USD155 plus4.22% processing fee (calculated totalUSD161.54 after cent rounding). Nonrefundable, credit-card payment via status portal. FAQ requires payment/approved waiver within3days of deadline; safest to pay at submission. [s3] [s4]",
