    "international": "[Standing rule] TOEFL before Jan 21, 2026:80 overall,20 speaking/writing; after Jan 22:4.5 overall,4 speaking/writing. IELTS 6.5 overall,6 each. TOEFL Home/MyBest/Paper and IELTS Online/One Skill Retake accepted. No Duolingo. Official agency reporting required; two-year validity. [s5] [s4] [Standing rule] Completed accredited U.S. degree usually waives testing. Currently enrolled UChicago applicant with at least one U.S. academic year and strong performance (example GPA≥3.0) may receive waiver. Department can override; teaching English rules are separate. Confirm waiver rather than infer from F-1 status. [s5] [s4] [Standing rule] Department’s all-PhD support statement and international application route indicate inclusion; confirm individual award and TA English eligibility. [s1] [s5]",
