    "greGeneral": "[Standing rule] Excluded from admissions process; not simply optional. [s1] [s2]",
    "greMath": "[Standing rule] Strictly optional. To submit, combine score report PDF with transcript or personal statement; no promise of advantage/disadvantage or official ETS subject-score requirement found. [s1] [s2]",
    "letters": "[Standing rule] Three required, up to five. UChicago/in-US applicants encouraged to obtain US-institution letters; detailed evidence/comparisons useful. [s1]",
    "writing": "[Standing rule] Required, concise with NO fixed math length cap. Prompt paraphrase: mathematical interests, research, publications, camps, teaching/tutoring and desired faculty; connect academic background/goals to Michigan. Upload with common header and >=1-inch margins. [s1] [s3]",
