    "deadlineDetails": "[2027 confirmed] 15 December 2026, 11:59 p.m. Eastern Time, for Mathematics application and applicant-uploaded materials. Revisions can later be uploaded through status portal, but no guarantee of review after initial evaluation. [s2] [s5]",
