    "deadlineDetails": "[2027 confirmed] MSc Fall 2027 explicitly open August 1 2026-February 1 2027. Department standing rule is February 1 for fall MSc/PhD, June 1 for winter; winter department date overrides central general schedule. Exact closing time/timezone not published. [a] [b]",
    "funding": "[Standing rule] MSc: no guaranteed annual amount posted; negotiate supervisor support. PhD: minimum CAD 18,000/year under policy effectiveFall 2025, including awards/teaching. Tuition is separate. 2026-27 international tuition reductions: research MSc CAD 15,916.05/three full-time terms; PhD CAD 24,067.80/three terms, reducing supplemental tuition - not a cash stipend or verified 2027-28 rate. [m] [n] [o]",
