    "deadlineDetails": "[Conflict] Homepage explicitly says November 1, 2026 to January 24, 2027. No hour/time zone published. Its heading simultaneously says cohort 2026-2028, inconsistent with those dates; confirm intended September 2027 intake. Generic apply page says mid-November opening. [home] [apply]",
