    "letters": "[Standing rule] At least two academic staff referees, identified by email address in the application. [apply]",
    "writing": "[Standing rule] Motivation letter required, uploaded. Faithful paraphrase: explain your interest in ALGANT and in mathematics generally. No public length/font/margin limit. [apply]",
    "warnings": "[Conflict] Homepage says opening November 1, 2026 and closing January 24, 2027 while labelling the master’s 2026-2028; generic instructions say opening mid-November. Host language policies may be newer than the 2023 FAQ and govern host admission. [home] [apply] [faq]",
