    "deadlineDetails": "[2027 confirmed] 8 January 2027 at 15:00 CET. The same cutoff applies to requests to change referee details. No extensions. Programme starts 15 September 2027, with no flexible start date. [a] [c]",
    "funding": "[Prior cycle] All PhD students are employees with full social-security/health coverage and conference/workshop support. Published 2026 gross monthly range€3,053-€3,673, paid14times/year (double paymentsJune/November). Arithmetic annual gross€42,742-€51,422; rate depends on bachelor/master entry and qualifying-exam stage. This is 2026, not a confirmed 2027 salary schedule. No tuition. [b] [d]",
