    "letters": "[Conflict] Conflicting public descriptions: current legal call says up to two professors; student wiki says at least one reference; old FAQ says two. Arrange two professors and ask admissions to confirm the mandatory 2027 minimum. No basis to treat zero letters as safe. [s2] [s4] [s6]",
