    "deadlineDetails": "[Conflict] MSc winter: May 31; summer: November 30, standing annual closing dates. Winter opening conflicts: department February 1, central catalogue January 1. Summer opens October 1. A separately dated 2027 mathematics cutoff clock was not established. A future doctorate has no central annual deadline, but advertised funded posts do. [s1] [s2] [s12]",
