    "fundingType": "Unknown",
    "overview": "[Standing rule] MSc: bachelor in mathematics, physics or a comparable field, subject-equivalence assessment and aptitude selection; a pending degree may apply with at least140 ECTS. UChicago eligibility depends on the course mapping. Current Graduate School instructions explicitly exclude bachelor-only doctoral admission and say no fast-track doctorate is offered; plan an MSc first. A later foreign master requires school recognition. [s1] [s2] [s5] [s12] [s14]",
