    "writing": "[Standing rule] MSc motivation letter in English, maximum 1-2 pages. Address academic/career goals, why this TUM programme, relevant skills and preparation beyond the basic curriculum such as internships, study abroad and additional courses; supporting evidence may be attached. This is a paraphrase of the instructions; the linked departmental page supplies the full wording. No font/spacing rule was found. [s1]",
