    "deadlineDetails": "[Standing rule] Standing September-entry schedule: opens 1 October; non-EU/EEA applicants 31 January, EU/EEA 30 June, stated 23:59 CEST. The page does not label the year and uses CEST even for January; confirm the 2027 portal time zone. Current Dutch-degree applicants may use the later route, which does not cover an ordinary UChicago BA. PhD vacancies set their own dates; no cohort deadline. [s1] [s7]",
