    "costs": "[Standing rule] MSc international-degree application fee €100, nonrefundable, paid as the final submission step. Listed methods include Mastercard/Visa, PayPal, Bancontact and iDEAL/Wero. Tuition is a separate charge; 2027-28 non-EEA mathematics tuition is €26,000/year. [s1] [s5]",
