    "writing": "[Standing rule] Required English motivation statement. Faithful paraphrase of six prompts: why this programme/Utrecht; relevant experience; preferred subject areas and reasons; evidence of required qualities; career/research goals; reflection on academic achievements. Generally 1-2 pages, not a stated hard maximum. Linked template or your own document may be uploaded; no font/margin rule given. [sop]",
